    (F2 * ‖x - y‖ * ‖w‖) (F1 * ‖w‖) (G2 * ‖x - y‖ * ‖v‖) (G1 * ‖v‖)
    (by positivity) (by positivity) (by positivity) (by positivity)
    (first_difference_eval_bound _ _ _ hfdl w) (first_eval_bound _ F1 hfd w)
